OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool School of Tropical
OL,4,AMedicine warns of potential
OL,5,Aredundancies
OL,6,
OL,7,FPotential job losses are being
OL,8,Fconsidered at the Liverpool School of
OL,9,FTropical Medicine (LSTM) as it seeks to
OL,10,Freduce costs and secure its long-term
OL,11,Ffuture.
OL,13,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,14,Fsaid a voluntary severance process had
OL,15,Falready taken place and that
OL,16,F"significant redundancies" were now
OL,17,Fbeing considered.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
