OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1792171535
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool School of Tropical
OL,4,AMedicine warns of potential
OL,5,Aredundancies
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccording to UCU, LSTM is seeking
OL,8,Fsavings of around #8m this financial
OL,9,Fyear, with similar savings planned over
OL,10,Fthe following two years. The union
OL,11,Fclaims staff have not been given a
OL,12,Fproper explanation of the plans.
OL,14,FLSTM said it faced "some very difficult
OL,15,Fdecisions" but was "committed" to
OL,16,Fworking with unions to agree an
OL,17,Fapproach that worked for staff and
OL,18,Ftheir members.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
